      "reason": "For y²=x/2, distance to directrix x=−1/8 is x+1/8=2y²+1/8. With A=(18,2), AP≥|18−x|. If x≤18, AP+PF≥18−x+x+1/8=18+1/8, equality at y=2, x=8. If x>18, AP+PF≥x−18+x+1/8>18+1/8. Thus the minimum is attained at (8,2)."
